<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">smart_toy</span>
</div>
<div class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 p-4 rounded-2xl rounded-tl-none max-w-[90%]">
<p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                                The biggest risk is the <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">OpenSSL vulnerability</span>. It allows remote attackers to decrypt secure traffic.
                            </p>
<p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
                                Based on current engineering velocity, fixing this will require <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2 sprints</span>. No extra budget is needed, just prioritization over the 'Dark Mode' feature update.
                            </p>
<div class="mt-3 flex gap-2">
<button class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">description</span>
